 "why": "A car wash in section: the car arrives, a hose smears mud, an arch with soap and cloth strips fixes it, and a floor drain leads to an underground reclaim tank where sand sinks and oil rises. A pump returns the water to the arch, and the myth is shown with a hose flooding the floor. I changed the two props to the allowed types kiosk and vacuum, ended the waste-water fill at the face, and re-aimed or tightened the shots so they hold the cut.",
