   "claim": "Driveway wash water flows untreated into storm drains and then into creeks, carrying soap, oil and grime.",
   "why": "EPA says wash water goes untreated into rivers and creeks. The CU Anschutz stormwater office says soap, grease and grime flow untreated into storm drains that run to streams.",
